{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">MONTH function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310076","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/MONTH-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/MONTH-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"MONTH-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">MONTH function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"MONTH-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Evaluates a date expression and returns a month INTEGER\nvalue from 1 to 12, inclusive.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"MONTH-function__syntax_GC19V12697160\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d186345e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"MONTH-function__idGDM2NE2672863\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>MONTH ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">date</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"MONTH-function__idGDM2NF2672869\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>MONTH ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">datetime-expression</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">date</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A date expression where you want a month value.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">datetime-expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An expression that evaluates to a DATETIME or DATETIME-TZ. The\nMONTH function returns the month of the date part of the DATETIME\nor DATETIME-TZ value.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"MONTH-function__example_GC19V22697168\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d186345e175\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure displays all the Orders that have a <code class=\"ph codeph\">PromiseDate</code> in\na month that has passed, and whose <code class=\"ph codeph\">ShipDate</code> field\nis the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>), which is the initial value of\nthe <code class=\"ph codeph\">ShipDate</code> field:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-mon.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"MONTH-function__idGDM2NG2672875\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>FOR EACH Order NO-LOCK:\n  IF <strong class=\"ph b\">(MONTH(Order.PromiseDate) &lt; MONTH(TODAY)</strong> OR\n    YEAR(Order.PromiseDate) &lt; YEAR(TODAY)) AND Order.ShipDate = ? THEN \n    DISPLAY Order.OrderNum LABEL &quot;Order Num&quot; Order.PO LABEL &quot;P.O. Num&quot;\n      Order.PromiseDate LABEL &quot;Promised By&quot;\n      Order.OrderDate LABEL &quot;Ordered&quot; terms\n      WITH TITLE &quot;These orders are overdue&quot;.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"MONTH-function__see-also_GC19V32697179\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d186345e225\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ADD-INTERVAL-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ADD-INTERVAL-function.html\">ADD-INTERVAL function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATE-function.html\">DATE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATE-FORMAT-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATE-FORMAT-attribute.html\">DATE-FORMAT attribute</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATETIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATETIME-function.html\">DATETIME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATETIME-TZ-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATETIME-TZ-function.html\">DATETIME-TZ function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DAY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DAY-function.html\">DAY function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ETIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ETIME-function.html\">ETIME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"INTERVAL-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/INTERVAL-function.html\">INTERVAL function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ISO-DATE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ISO-DATE-function.html\">ISO-DATE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"MTIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/MTIME-function.html\">MTIME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"NOW-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/NOW-function.html\">NOW function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TIME-function.html\">TIME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TIMEZONE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TIMEZONE-function.html\">TIMEZONE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TODAY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TODAY-function.html\">TODAY function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"WEEKDAY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/WEEKDAY-function.html\">WEEKDAY function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"YEAR-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/YEAR-function.html\">YEAR function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"YEAR-OFFSET-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/YEAR-OFFSET-attribute.html\">YEAR-OFFSET attribute</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"MODULO-operator.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/MODULO-operator.html\">MODULO operator</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"MTIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/MTIME-function.html\">MTIME function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310076","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"MONTH function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/MONTH-function.html","type":"Manual"}